@segment 16-20 Barrens Loops, Eastern Stonetalon & Thunder Bluff
@start-level 16
@carry 1061,851,855,3301
@done 850,903,869,848,902,4921
# Starts at the Crossroads after the Orgrimmar wind rider round trip of segment 4. The hearth is
# bound at the Crossroads and stays there for the whole segment.
# Carried in: 851 Verog and 855 Centaur Bracers (finish them on loop 1), 1061 for Seereth
# Stonebreak (Stonetalon border) and 3301 Mura Runetotem (segment 6, the Sepulcher).
# Ends in Thunder Bluff at level 20 with Call of Water accepted, then one flight to
# Sun Rock Retreat to hand in Boulderslide Ravine. Segment 6 starts with a flight to Ratchet.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Crossroads: pick up the quests for this segment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
A 881 | Sergra Darkthorn. She gives you the Horn of Echeyakee
A 867 | Darsok Swiftdagger
A 3281 | Gazrog. The silver lies in a raptor nest at the Raptor Grounds; you get it on loop 2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loop 1 (north): Echeyakee, Witchwing harpies, the Kolkar
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
C 881 @ The Barrens, 55.6, 17.2 | Run north-east from the Crossroads to the giant kodo bones. Blow the Horn of Echeyakee there; the white lion comes to you. Kill it and loot its hide
C 867 @ The Barrens, 40.5, 16.5 | Witchwing harpies in the north-west Barrens drop the talons. Stay on the east side of the roost; the Slayers further west hit harder. Earth Shock the Windcallers' casts
C 851,855 @ The Barrens, 44.0, 25.0 | Kolkar centaurs around Barak's old camp drop the bracers. Verog the Dervish appears after enough centaurs in the area die; he is level 18: open with Earth Shock, drop Stoneclaw Totem and heal with Healing Wave below half health
T 851,855 | Regthar Deathgate, on the road west of the Crossroads
A 852 | Hezrul leads the Kolkar at Lushwater Oasis; he comes on the next loop
T 881 | Sergra Darkthorn, Crossroads
A 905 | The feathers drop from any Sunscale raptor; you will pass both raptor areas on the next loop
T 867 | Darsok Swiftdagger
A 875
A 95774 @ The Barrens, 52.0, 31.6 | Mankrik (NEW). You collect the adornments next to his wife's body on the next loop

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loop 2 (south-east): Ratchet, Raptor Grounds, Northwatch, the oases, harpies again
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
FLY Ratchet
A 3921,1483 | Sputtervalve: Wenikee is in the north Barrens, Ziz Fizziks is at Windshear Crag in Stonetalon
A 865,1069 | Mebok Mizzyrix. The raptor horns come next; the spider eggs are in Stonetalon later in this segment
A 891 | Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun
C 865,3281 @ The Barrens, 57.0, 53.0 | Raptor Grounds, south along the coast road: Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the horns and every Sunscale raptor can drop a feather for The Angry Scytheclaws (get 3). The Stolen Silver lies in a nest at 58.0, 53.9. If a second raptor joins, Stoneclaw Totem holds it off
C 891 @ The Barrens, 61.8, 54.7 | Northwatch Hold: Theramore Marines and Preservers drop the medals. Kill Captain Fairmount (61.9, 54.7), Cannoneer Whessan (60.4, 54.8) and Cannoneer Smythe (63.2, 56.6); they are 19-20, so clear the guards around each first. Pull one at a time, Earth Shock the Preservers' heals and Healing Wave between pulls
A 898 @ The Barrens, 62.0, 55.0 | Gilthares Firebough is a prisoner inside the hold
C 898 @ The Barrens, 62.0, 55.0 | Tell him you are ready and escort him north up the coast to Ratchet. Marines ambush on the way: drop Stoneclaw and Searing Totem and keep them on you, not on him. If he dies, take the quest from him again
T 891,898 | Captain Brightsun, Ratchet
T 865 | Mebok Mizzyrix
C 905 @ The Barrens, 52.3, 46.4 | Head west to the three Scytheclaw nests south-west of the Stagnant Oasis and use a feather on each
C 95774 @ The Barrens, 49.6, 51.4 | South-west to Mankrik's wife's body (49.3, 50.3): kill the quilboars around it (Mankrik calls them Razormane Raiders) until 4 Olgra's Adornments drop
C 852 @ The Barrens, 46.0, 41.1 | North to Lushwater Oasis: Hezrul Bloodmark (19) is at the Kolkar camp on the south bank. Clear the centaurs near him first and fight him alone
T 852 | Regthar Deathgate. He then offers Counterattack! (elite group quest): skip it
C 875 @ The Barrens, 38.9, 14.5 | Back to the Witchwing roost: Witchwing Slayers drop the Harpy Lieutenant Rings
T 875 | Darsok Swiftdagger, Crossroads
A 876
T 905 | Sergra Darkthorn
A 3261
T 3281 | Gazrog. Do NOT take Apothecary Zamah from Helbrim yet: it is timed, you take it at the very end
T 95774 @ The Barrens, 52.0, 31.6 | Mankrik

