# Loop 3 (north): Wenikee, Vrang Wildgore's camp (NEW), Serena
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
T 3921 | Wenikee Boltbucket, north of the Crossroads
A 3922
C 3922 @ The Barrens, 56.3, 8.3 | Sludge Fen, to the east: loot the Tool Buckets around the Venture Co. camp
T 3922 | Wenikee Boltbucket
A 3923 | For segment 6 (Rilli Greasygob, Orgrimmar)
A 95494,95507 @ The Barrens, 43.8, 12.2 | Vrang Wildgore (NEW), the injured hunter west of Wenikee
C 95494,95507 @ The Barrens, 44.5, 15.0 | Savannah Patriarch lions in the valley below Vrang drop the hides (more Savannah Matriarchs roam north-west of Ratchet if these run out). Loot the Sprung Traps scattered through the same valley for the Trapped Game
T 95494,95507 @ The Barrens, 43.8, 12.2 | Vrang Wildgore
A 95495 @ The Barrens, 43.8, 12.2 | He gives you a Bundle of Hides for the hermit on the ridge behind him
T 95495 @ The Barrens, 42.0, 11.4 | Walton, on top of the ridge
A 95621 @ The Barrens, 42.0, 11.4
C 95621 @ The Barrens, 41.8, 15.5 | Kill the Kul Tiras soldiers camped at the wrecked caravan south of the ridge until Benedict's Orders drop
T 95621 @ The Barrens, 42.0, 11.4 | Walton
A 95508 @ The Barrens, 42.0, 11.4
C 95508 @ The Barrens, 41.8, 11.4 | Stay next to Walton: Terry Longdrink and his marines come up the ridge. Put Stoneclaw and Searing Totem down beside Walton and help him kill them all
T 95508 @ The Barrens, 42.0, 11.4 | Walton
C 876 @ The Barrens, 39.2, 12.2 | Serena Bloodfeather (20) stands at the back of the Witchwing roost. Clear the harpies around her first, then pull her alone; Healing Wave early rather than late
H Crossroads | If the hearth is still on cooldown, run back south-east to the Crossroads
T 876 | Darsok Swiftdagger
A 1060 | Deliver it to Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon, next

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stonetalon Mountains (south-east corner, Windshear Crag, Sun Rock)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
T 1061 | Run west along the road past Regthar to the Stonetalon border: Seereth Stonebreak
A 1062
A 6548 | Makaba Flathoof, next to Seereth
C 6548 | Camp Aparaje, Makaba's raided village just inside Stonetalon to the west: kill Grimtotem Ruffians and Mercenaries
T 6548 | Makaba Flathoof
A 6629
C 6629 | Grimtotem Post, a bit further west up the path from Camp Aparaje: kill the Grimtotem Brutes and Grundig Darkcloud (18) by the cage. Pull Grundig on his own; drop Stoneclaw Totem if a Brute joins
A 6523 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 73.5, 85.6 | Kaya Flathoof, the captive next to Grundig
C 6523 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 73.5, 85.6 | Escort Kaya back along the path to Camp Aparaje, the camp where you killed the Ruffians. Grimtotems ambush her when she arrives: drop Stoneclaw Totem and kill them fast. If she dies, take the quest from her again
T 6629,6523 | Makaba Flathoof
A 6401 @ The Barrens, 35.2, 27.8 | Tell Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat, later on this trip
A 6461 | Xen'Zilla at Malaka'jin, the troll camp south-west of the Grimtotem Post
T 1060 | Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, in the cave at the back of Malaka'jin
C 6461:1 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 64.5, 85.0 | Kill Deepmoss Creepers along the road north-west of Malaka'jin (around 61-68, 81-93, then 58-61, 72-79) on your way north. Do not go west into Sishir Canyon (about 52-56, 71-76): it is the lair of Besseleth, a level 21 elite spider. You pass her wanted poster on the road (59.1, 75.7): skip Arachnophobia, it is elite
T 1483 | Ziz Fizziks, the gnome on the south-west edge of Windshear Crag
A 1093
C 1062,1093,1069,6461:2 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 63.5, 55.0 | Windshear Crag: kill Venture Co. Loggers, loot the blueprints from a Venture Co. Operator, pick up Deepmoss Eggs under the remaining trees and kill Deepmoss Venomspitters. Watch for the patrolling shredders; leave them for later
T 1093 | Ziz Fizziks
A 1094 | For Sputtervalve in Ratchet
C 6461:2 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 52.6, 58.5 | Only if you still need Deepmoss Venomspitters: more roam the slopes just east of Sun Rock (52-54, 54-62), on your way west. Finish them here: on the way south to the cave the only other Venomspitters are in Besseleth's canyon
F Sun Rock Retreat @ Stonetalon Mountains, 45.1, 59.8 | Tharm, the wind rider master on the west side of Sun Rock Retreat
T 6401 | Tammra Windfield
A 6421 | Mor'rogal
C 6421 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 58.5, 89.5 | Follow the road south from Sun Rock, past the wanted poster, to the Boulderslide Ravine cave: kobolds drop Resonite Crystals and more crystals lie on the cave floor. Go all the way to the back of the cave for the investigation credit. Creepers along the road count for Blood Feeders, but do not cut through Sishir Canyon (about 53, 73): Besseleth (21, elite) lives there
C 6461 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 64.5, 85.0 | On the way back to Malaka'jin, finish any Deepmoss Creepers you still need (around 61-69, 81-93). Venomspitters do not live this far south
T 6461 | Xen'Zilla, Malaka'jin
T 1062 | Seereth Stonebreak
A 1063,1068 @ The Barrens, 35.3, 27.9 | Magatha is in Thunder Bluff (end of this segment); Shredding Machines is for segment 7

