# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Thunder Bluff
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
A 742 | Bluff Runner Windstrider, near the lifts. For segment 7 (Splintertree Post, Ashenvale)
F Thunder Bluff @ Thunder Bluff, 47.0, 49.8 | Tal, the wind rider master in the middle of the main rise
A 1195 | Zangen Stonehoof, main rise. You fill his phial at an Ashenvale moonwell in segment 7
T 1063 | Magatha Grimtotem, Elder Rise (the north-east bluff). Watch the 853 timer; go to Zamah first if it is low
A 1064
A 264 | Clarice Foster, Spirit Rise (the north-west bluff). For segment 6 (Yuriv's tomb, Silverpine)
T 853 | Apothecary Zamah, in the Pools of Vision: the cave under Spirit Rise, reached by a path on Spirit Rise
T 1064 | Apothecary Zamah
A 1065 | For segment 6 (Tarren Mill)
TRAIN @ Thunder Bluff, 22.8, 21.1 | The shaman trainers stand in the Pools of Vision next to Zamah: learn your level 18 and 20 spells, including Ghost Wolf (+40% run speed outdoors; your travel form until the mount), Frost Shock and Lesser Healing Wave
A 1529 | Xanis Flameweaver, beside the shaman trainers: Call of Water (needs 20). Take only this one; the other three Call of Water starters are the same quest
FLY Sun Rock Retreat
T 6421 | Mor'rogal. He then offers Earthen Arise (elite): skip it. Segment 6 starts with a flight to Ratchet from here
